# XSH closedir()
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.

assertion  XSH.closedir.001
anchor     functions/closedir.html#DESCRIPTION
class      required
since      1988
says       closedir() of a stream from opendir() returns 0, and the descriptor
           dirfd() had returned is then no longer open; likewise for a
           stream from fdopendir() and the descriptor given to it.
test       t/001-closes-fd.c
